{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：10:27 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"荃灣中心女子燒炭死亡。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/e7b0eea77f2bdd375af99a04e09c5aa4/2026-10/page_170.jpg\"/>\n<p>荃灣發生燒炭事件。今日（22日）早上7時52分，警方接獲報案，指荃景圍103號荃灣中心一名女子企圖自殺。人員到場，發現女事主倒斃於單位內，其身旁有一盆炭，正調查事件原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:02:40.203171+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:27:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:38:10.379460+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T02:58:02.943377+00:00","content_hash":"658f637498e0f99c6fe91e968dc2d9b0d52675584f36cda3a042b767443fb0e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}